    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89e5f818845ba6e0e307d91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛",
      "source_fingerprint": "567703d9275812a37613cd54f05008f5fba9ac6c5086fcadc58481ab61c51fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266c79a105d809a2cde23f26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏有训练员的帮助，\n好歌剧才会告诉我说，\n我是她的“左右手”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34f72a6a3523144c51fe023c53f949f82282c0d4daa4e31331dd93987572bf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b615c823004f110af53184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛",
      "source_fingerprint": "567703d9275812a37613cd54f05008f5fba9ac6c5086fcadc58481ab61c51fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f716ad0defba4ee910fdf55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我觉得自己还能再努力一点……\n但没关系……毕竟我崇拜的好歌剧\n认可我了嘛。欸嘿嘿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b27bd17eb40f21e94733c4b89c22dbb803fdead0191b359e7ca2b3c7eea80e18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f617dae7db6ccd778f75cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我早就──知道答案了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c31446dbf4618fb53b3302d5fcd890cfab206372678ccf5a41815293096216a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b632ee17acd20b589ee8c54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一直──都有看到答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fec3fa6f3e3feaa0af6415d803efa2ccd7b06de64e0a9b9bffe7abed90dcea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc6235afb4d3c6246518f52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天花板的真面目──\n那对名将怒涛而言就是“救赎”。\n也是她之所以能努力至今最主要的原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaaec44c1388b7890f98d56bef1094bb64ac71867f53db4619903035725f8688",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8720ad65b756cf00c38d1e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e675a751a02376dc54b1b2892d4a4f859f0505240d1cc6277fe26728ca618f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ed8b89b8ec324c15ca464b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错！这场胜仗都是多亏有你！\n怒涛你也算是虽败犹荣了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b593386e70691cd088c8e8be8a4d6fd8b6de44cc61b9f9fa3be98c0b907348d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f857c9158969ac67062ca33d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对好歌剧所怀抱着的\n“心意”及“顾虑”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "506812fc1977ad516b5b9cb268f0095935f2dc807b8e86ca76cd4c29883bc9bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6233e5f2ed4f15a8530987a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……只有一个人能和我讨论这件事。\n于是我决定问问爱慕织姬的意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b15a019550a8a57f8ade3dbde38bd3e74bc19d52577c247feb1321a815f19e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6dcb435dd10d6fcff5638e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c8d9459793dab04c3766a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然不出我所料……而且这次的状况\n让一切都水落石出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a3fefa0343b1975275a0ef84b77b485fa6a1182254dd6cda96d9cf13664465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357a5659510d1f33004e8976",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的意思是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0521fe58148a447f3b4a6f6c10e79d0bc2715f5e06a4e068b893eebf3d32ea3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1417c8bf8025e70ac8898bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c7cabc207f73f174f93f04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就真正的意义来说──\n怒涛她并未拥有什么自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccf992c5533a666503a1873a6440d68aa2cea81115e682618e5cab5f4f3da5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2e375b06b9fb391dcd835e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d31a97899a605ab08eae013",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为她一直在以好歌剧为标准在看待事情。\n像是“要帮上好歌剧的忙”、“要追上她”，\n或是“要受到她认可”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b828829292eda57911944dc9a0fb19979823bd144da2b1859382c636fe6fb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8c6412fab26c2948ece55c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d6ca2ec496e3bc02423d804",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连自己是否有十分耀眼这点，\n都要交给好歌剧判断……",
      "source_fingerprint": "954e5aedbed9598d63a4c096ec13a707acb3ce7e66b2913b07aa2ac65c740181",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60483fada1d5b273188754d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce174b4fa5a04c21d808a7ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而怒涛并未完全成长的这个缺点，\n也影响到了好歌剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f45c4bcaf3940979374b27c7605e170d67fc7c9577538bb95266973098161cc2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701c57f6bef728cec93c7fa3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff7bc1d49a2b019d47befd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今，好歌剧已经是\n闪耀系列赛的招牌赛马娘之一了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94dc256617b23097e7902db2b37c650e48c10c51c7b88f4ba2967f469cd0c40c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25b6a68271e76e9f861fe456",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬",
      "source_fingerprint": "133221201a09546ab4acd4d3464f307913be827dafcf84f30563c8c657e48319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc78000ca6de4fd18e4cf47a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，才需要一个能助她成长的劲敌。\n照理来说，怒涛应该得从旁担任那个角色，\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d92d5310a3e479c3ec9eea18cf1c211d705b645021cb401aa19d929f5805e7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca84d458d217d9904935792b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许真如爱慕织姬所言，\n停滞不前的人并不只有名将怒涛而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd884b9c9ed60512c5986a209a6760f2bafc17a7b3e4a1edee75a48e7235bcfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be8ceb958c358f967415065b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众A",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee86b64dc7889c9a8a0c3464472500fce48b2487b81ae5e25e0e3845b56d9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41459a24166c0b8b251ebc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔──好歌剧跟怒涛都挺厉害的嘛。\n她们差不多追上最强世代了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2ff9e25c004ec7720e9655e5053d59a241e392077737f706947ff248c6423d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
